  "story": {
    "day": 20,
    "title": "Kaya's Quiet Thursday",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a cold Thursday in October, so Kaya stayed home.",
      "She looked through the window and saw a big green tree.",
      "There was no sun, but the sky was a light blue.",
      "Kaya always practiced her violin because her next lesson was Saturday.",
      "Mr. Tanaka made a telephone call to her about a new textbook.",
      "\"Is my new notebook on the computer table?\" Kaya asked.",
      "She saw her white doll and a purple toy boat there.",
      "Kaya brushed her long hair and then checked her gold watch.",
      "Finally, she sat down to watch a cool movie on the TV."
    ]
  }
